---@field chartStyle? posthog.dashboards.ChartStyle|distilled.Null Chart rendering style overrides (line shape).
---@field confidenceLevel? number|distilled.Null
---@field decimalPlaces? number|distilled.Null Maximum number of decimal places shown. 1 or 2 is usually right for percentages and currency.
---@field detailedResultsAggregationType? posthog.dashboards.DetailedResultsAggregationType|distilled.Null detailed results table
---@field display? posthog.dashboards.ChartDisplayType|distilled.Null
---@field excludeBoxPlotOutliers? boolean|distilled.Null
---@field formula? string|distilled.Null
